---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Wanlian Fluid Equipment"
  description="Privacy policy for Quanzhou Wanlian Fluid Equipment Co., Ltd. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal data when you contact us."
>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 mb-20">
    <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-blue-600 uppercase">Legal</span>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-2 mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-12">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-10 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">1. Who We Are</h2>
        <p>
          Quanzhou Wanlian Fluid Equipment Co., Ltd. ("Wanlian", "we", "us") operates the website
          <a href="https://wanlian911.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">wanlian911.com</a>.
          We are a B2B fluid equipment enterprise providing industrial valves, fire protection equipment and fluid-control
          systems, headquartered in Quanzhou, Fujian Province, China.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          For any privacy-related question, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:dhuog77@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">dhuog77@gmail.com</a>
          or by phone / WhatsApp at +86 186 8432 4501.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Inquiry form data:</strong> full name, email address, company name, country/region, product of interest and message content that you submit through our RFQ / inquiry form.</li>
          <li><strong>Communication data:</strong> information you provide by email, WhatsApp or phone.</li>
          <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> basic log information such as IP address, browser type, pages visited and referral source, processed for security and site operation.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>To respond to inquiries and prepare quotations for our products and services.</li>
          <li>To provide technical support, drawings, documentation and after-sales service.</li>
          <li>To operate and secure the website.</li>
          <li>To comply with applicable laws and regulations.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We do not sell your personal data. We only use it for the business purposes described above.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Formspree:</strong> processes our inquiry form submissions and delivers them to our sales email. Their privacy policy applies to data they process on our behalf.</li>
          <li><strong>Cloudflare Turnstile:</strong> an anti-bot verification widget. It may process your IP address to determine whether you are a human visitor. Cloudflare's privacy policy applies.</li>
          <li><strong>WhatsApp / Meta:</strong> used for customer communication when you choose to contact us via WhatsApp.</li>
          <li><strong>LinkedIn:</strong> we link to our company page; your interaction with LinkedIn is governed by LinkedIn's privacy policy.</li>
          <li><strong>Google Fonts:</strong> fonts are loaded from Google servers, which may receive your IP address.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">5. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
        <p>
          This website is a static site and does not set marketing cookies itself. Third-party services
          (such as Cloudflare and Google Fonts) may place technically necessary cookies or similar
          technologies. We do not use your data for advertising profiling.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">6. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
          Inquiry and correspondence data is retained as long as needed to serve you and to fulfil our
          legitimate business and legal obligations (e.g. quotations, order history and after-sales service).
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">7. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>
          Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to access, correct, delete or restrict
          the processing of your personal data. To exercise any of these rights, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:dhuog77@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">dhuog77@gmail.com</a>.
          We will respond within a reasonable timeframe.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">8. Data Security</h2>
        <p>
          We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect your personal data against
          unauthorised access, loss or alteration. Data is transmitted over encrypted connections (HTTPS).
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">9. International Transfers</h2>
        <p>
          As a China-based enterprise serving customers worldwide, data you submit may be transferred to
          and processed in China and by third-party service providers in other countries. By submitting an
          inquiry you consent to this transfer for the purpose of responding to your request.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page
          reflects the latest revision. Significant changes will be reflected on this page.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
